<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>PSYCHO</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">mxlu, shady MOON</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">PSYCHO</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">40YUnyPFd8qkkWRZaWRBn8</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.050" end="00:17.620">$upreme, you're a bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.620" end="00:19.520">Psycho, go dumb, go stupid (Oh, shit)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.520" end="00:21.980">Fuckin' with this bitch, I've been shot by Cupid (That's wack)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.980" end="00:24.090">Hatin' on my shit, now they wanna be included (Ayy-ayy, ayy, ayy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.090" end="00:26.400">Bad bitch get it, and they know me as ruthless</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.400" end="00:28.830">So much drip, I got 1's on my feet (All white)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.830" end="00:30.660">Real ass nigga, I ain't ever gon' cheat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.660" end="00:33.170">They say, "Malu up next", you can't do it like me and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.170" end="00:35.290">She wanna be my bae, but she only 2D</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.290" end="00:37.620">Like, hol' up (Wait), run it up, run it up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.620" end="00:39.780">Tell her, "Turn around, back it up, back it up" (Throw it back)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.780" end="00:41.880">You still talkin' shit but I don't give a fuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.880" end="00:44.260">I just want a show at a five star club (No fucks)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.260" end="00:46.630">Like, maybe, do she think that I'm crazy?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.630" end="00:48.730">Smokin' on this loud, man, I'm feeling so lazy (So high)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.730" end="00:50.840">I ain't bloodin', but the nigga too brazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.840" end="00:52.340">Don't fuck her friends (You make me sick-sick-sick-sick, ayy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.170" end="00:53.670">'Cause these niggas be shady</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.450" end="00:55.390">Your bitch psycho, when she on the dick, she go stupid</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.390" end="00:57.780">This a .40 round cal', hittin' those lookin' clueless</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.780" end="01:00.130">You still with the snakes, I should call your ass Lucas</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.130" end="01:02.260">Bad bitch, couldn't give a fuck if I'm losin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.260" end="01:04.300">Lil' shawty wanna slide, but I told her, "Hol' up" (Hol' up)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.300" end="01:06.470">She with the shits, so lil' shawty finna show what's up (Yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.470" end="01:08.890">Hop in the Benz, Bentley truck, you gon' take the bus</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.890" end="01:11.110">FN's with extendos, it'll blast your buck (Ahh, ahh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.110" end="01:13.370">Why your bitch stay obsessin' when your pockets anorexic?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.370" end="01:15.400">My goth bitch might dub yo' ass if you testin' (Fuck you, Shady)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.400" end="01:17.850">Shady finna push your whole fam' in depression</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.850" end="01:19.940">Don't speak when I say, "Lil' shorty, who you pressin'?"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.940" end="01:22.350">Like, baby, what you doin' on a daily?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.350" end="01:24.870">You callin' my name, lil' shorty, yes, I'm Shady</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.870" end="01:26.670">Tryna figure if your friends the same b'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.670" end="01:29.040">Tap lil' shorty two times, Instagraming hoes lately</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.040" end="01:31.670">Like, wait (What?), just fuck out my face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.670" end="01:33.270">Always in the way, but I'm takin' first place (First place)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.270" end="01:35.680">Niggas talkin' shit, but I keep a straight face (Straight face)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.680" end="01:37.930">Stay talkin' money, I'm all-in for the chase</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.930" end="01:40.330">Say I'm down bad, but you askin' for a promo' (Promo')</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.330" end="01:42.580">Summer time shit, man, I'm tryna take a photo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.580" end="01:44.960">Don't kill my vibe, I'm just here on the low, low (On the low, low)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.960" end="01:47.320">Malu up next, yeah, I been got the memo (Oh, shit)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.320" end="01:49.470">My song's a vibe, I'm a ten, you a zero (I'm a ten)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.470" end="01:51.820">Keep goin' at it like you got max ammo (Oh, shit)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.820" end="01:53.860">Wait for the day that I'm havin' a real show (Show)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.860" end="01:56.200">Movin' so fast but you niggas in slow-mo (Slow-mo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.200" end="01:58.370">Tough, yeah, I know I'm the shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.370" end="02:00.730">It's all 'bout my fans, I don't care 'bout shit (Like, sup?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.730" end="02:02.660">Remember the days I was just gonna quit (Okay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.660" end="02:05.260">Shout-out my brother for keeping my wish (Wait)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.260" end="02:07.610">Psycho, go dumb, go stupid (Oh, shit)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.610" end="02:09.590">Fuckin' with this bitch, I've been shot by Cupid (That's wack)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.590" end="02:11.830">Hatin' on my shit, now they wanna be included (Ayy-ayy, ayy, ayy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.830" end="02:14.220">Bad bitch get it, and they know me as ruthless</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.220" end="02:16.870">So much drip, I got 1's on my feet (All white)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.870" end="02:18.420">Real ass nigga, I ain't ever gon' cheat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.420" end="02:20.530">They say, "Malu up next", you can't do it like me and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.530" end="02:22.940">She wanna be my bae, but she only 2D</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.940" end="02:25.030">Like, hol' up (Wait), run it up, run it up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.030" end="02:27.690">Tell her, "Turn around, back it up, back it up" (Throw it back)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.690" end="02:29.890">You still talkin' shit but I don't give a fuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.890" end="02:32.190">I just want a show at a five star club (No fucks)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.190" end="02:34.360">Like, maybe, do she think that I'm crazy?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.360" end="02:36.760">Smokin' on this loud, man, I'm feeling so lazy (So high)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.760" end="02:38.730">I ain't bloodin', but the nigga too brazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.730" end="02:40.950">Don't fuck her friends (Ayy), 'cause these niggas be shady</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.950" end="02:43.740" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Niggas be shady, 'cause these niggas be shady)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.740" end="02:47.740" /></div></body></tt>